Build a complete School Management System website using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.

Website-ku ha noqdo mid modern, professional, responsive, oo si fiican uga shaqeeya mobile, tablet iyo computer.

1. Student Search

Samee page ama section la yiraahdo Student Search oo maamulka uu ardayga ku raadin karo:

- Magaca ardayga
- Student ID
- Fasalka

Marka ardayga la raadiyo, soo muuji:

- Magaca ardayga
- Student ID
- Fasalka
- Lambarka waalidka
- Taariikhda diiwaangelinta
- Status-ka ardayga

2. Student Registration

Samee Student Registration Form oo lagu diiwaangelin karo arday cusub.

Foomku ha lahaado:

- Full Name
- Student ID
- Gender
- Date of Birth
- Class / Grade
- Parent/Guardian Name
- Parent Phone Number
- Address
- Registration Date
- Student Photo

Marka foomka la submit-gareeyo, xogta ardayga ha lagu daro Student List, kadibna laga raadin karo Student Search.

3. Class Management

Samee qayb la yiraahdo Classes.

Admin-ku ha awoodi karo:

- Inuu sameeyo class cusub
- Inuu magaca class-ka geliyo
- Inuu doorto Grade
- Inuu geliyo Room Number
- Inuu doorto macallinka class-ka
- Inuu arko tirada ardayda class-ka

Tusaale:

- Grade 1A
- Grade 1B
- Grade 2A
- Grade 3A
- Grade 4A
- Grade 5A

4. Teacher Management

Samee qayb la yiraahdo Teachers oo maamulka uu ku diiwaangelin karo macallimiinta.

Teacher Form ha lahaado:

- Teacher Name
- Teacher ID
- Phone Number
- Email
- Subject
- Class
- Gender
- Address
- Date Joined
- Teacher Photo

Admin-ku ha awoodi karo inuu:

- Add Teacher
- Edit Teacher
- Delete Teacher
- Search Teacher
- Arko classes-ka uu macallinku dhigayo.

5. Dashboard

Samee Admin Dashboard oo homepage-ka maamulka ka muuqdaan statistics:

- Total Students
- Total Teachers
- Total Classes
- New Students
- Active Students

Dashboard-ku ha lahaado cards iyo charts fudud oo professional ah.

6. Student List

Samee table ay ka muuqdaan dhammaan ardayda:

Student ID| Name| Class| Parent Phone| Status| Action

Action-ka ha lahaado:

- View
- Edit
- Delete

7. Class Form

Marka admin-ku sameynayo class cusub, foomka ha lahaado:

- Class Name
- Grade
- Section
- Room Number
- Class Teacher
- Maximum Students

Kadib class-ka ha ka muuqdo Classes List.

8. Teacher → Class Assignment

Samee system admin-ku ku xiriirin karo:
Teacher → Class → Students

Tusaale:

Teacher: Ahmed Hassan
Class: Grade 5A
Students: 35

Marka class-ka la furo, waa in la arki karaa macallinka iyo dhammaan ardayda class-kaas.

9. Navigation Menu

Website-ku ha lahaado sidebar/menu:

- Dashboard
- Students
- Add Student
- Teachers
- Add Teacher
- Classes
- Add Class
- Student Search
- Reports
- Settings
- Logout

10. Design

Design-ku ha noqdo:

- Modern school management dashboard
- Clean UI
- Professional
- Responsive
- Mobile friendly
- Easy to use
- Search bars
- Tables
- Cards
- Forms
- Modal windows
- Confirmation before deleting

Isticmaal HTML5 + CSS3 + Vanilla JavaScript.

11. Data Storage

Maadaama tani tahay frontend version, isticmaal localStorage si xogta ardayda, macallimiinta iyo classes-ka browser-ka loogu keydiyo.

Marka page-ka la refresh-gareeyo, xogtu ha sii jirto.

Code-ka u kala saar:

- "index.html"
- "style.css"
- "script.js"

Code-ku ha noqdo mid nadiif ah, comments leh, oo si fudud dambe loogu xiriirin karo backend/database.

12. Important

Dhammaan forms-ku waa inay si dhab ah u shaqeeyaan:

- Add Student → Student List
- Add Teacher → Teacher List
- Add Class → Class List
- Search Student → Student information
- Edit → Update information
- Delete → Remove information
- Assign Teacher → Class
- Assign Student → Class

Ha sameynin website muuqaal kaliya ah. Samee functional frontend school management system oo xogta lagu dari karo, lagu raadin karo, lagu sixi karo laguna tirtiri karo.
